@startuml Sequence_Diagram_Activity_Logging
title Sequence Diagram — CO2 Activity Logging Flow

skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  ParticipantBorderColor #1565C0
  ActorBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  ActorBorderColor #2E7D32
  ArrowColor #37474F
  LifeLineBorderColor #90A4AE
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  NoteBorderColor #F9A825
  FontSize 12
}

actor "User" as User
participant "Flutter App\n(UI Layer)" as App
participant "Activity\nLogging Page" as LogPage
participant "Carbon\nFactors Service" as CarbonSvc
participant "Validation\nLayer" as Validator
participant "Firebase\nFirestore" as Firestore
participant "Dashboard\nPage" as Dashboard
participant "Achievement\nService" as AchieveSvc

== User Initiates Activity Logging ==

User -> App : Tap "Log Activity"
App -> LogPage : Navigate to logging screen
LogPage --> User : Display activity form\n(Transport / Energy / Diet)

User -> LogPage : Enter activity details\n(e.g., 15 km by car)

== Emission Calculation ==

LogPage -> Validator : Validate input fields
alt Invalid input
  Validator --> LogPage : Return validation errors
  LogPage --> User : Show error message
else Valid input
  Validator --> LogPage : Input approved
  LogPage -> CarbonSvc : fetchEmissionFactor(activityType)
  CarbonSvc --> LogPage : Return factor\n(e.g., 0.21 kg CO2/km)
  LogPage -> LogPage : Calculate total emissions\n(15 km × 0.21 = 3.15 kg CO2)
end

== Persist Data to Firebase ==

LogPage -> Firestore : saveActivityLog(userId, activityData, co2Kg)
note right of Firestore
  Collection: "activity_logs"
  Fields: userId, type, value,
  co2_kg, timestamp
end note
Firestore --> LogPage : Write confirmed (document ID)

== Update Dashboard ==

LogPage -> Dashboard : Emit event: activityLogged
Dashboard -> Firestore : fetchEmissionHistory(userId)
Firestore --> Dashboard : Latest emission records
Dashboard --> User : Refresh charts & total CO2

== Check Achievements ==

Dashboard -> AchieveSvc : checkMilestones(userId, totalCO2)
alt Milestone reached
  AchieveSvc -> Firestore : unlockAchievement(userId, badgeId)
  AchieveSvc --> User : Show badge notification\n"🏆 Green Commuter Unlocked!"
else No milestone
  AchieveSvc --> Dashboard : No new achievements
end

@enduml
